# MRI Data

Place MRI data files here (structural and functional).

## Expected Subdirectories

- `structural/` - Anatomical MRI scans
- `functional/` - Resting-state fMRI data
- `DBM/` - Deformation-based morphometry outputs
- `Atlas/` - Brain atlas files

NIfTI files (.nii, .nii.gz) should be organized by subject and session.
